      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright Â© 2012 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a case of a 62-year-old man with a history of type II diabetes mellitus who presented to our emergency department with back pain and right upper quadrant abdominal pain associated with vomiting and weight loss. A computed tomographic scan of the abdomen and pelvis demonstrated a large adrenal mass, and subsequent biopsy showed primary adrenal lymphoma."
